SUMMARY:Onside TV v3.0.0
DESCRIPTION:Onside TV 3.0.0 | OnsideTV_V3.0.0\n\n### **Nebulo is now Onside
  TV!**\nSame app\, new name\, and the biggest update so far.\n\n### **Read
  this before you install**\n- **You need iOS 26 or newer.** If your phone 
 is on an older version\, stay on Nebulo V2.3 for now.\n- **Onside TV insta
 lls as a new app next to Nebulo.** You'll have to log in again\, and your 
 favorites and settings from Nebulo won't carry over. Once you're set up yo
 u can delete Nebulo.\n- **There's just one IPA this time**\, no backup ver
 sion.\n\n### **What's New**\n- **New look:** Liquid Glass all through the 
 app\, a new home screen with big channel cards and a full screen hero at t
 he top.\n- **Way bigger sports section:** Game cards with lineups\, stats\
 , momentum\, shot maps\, win probability and box scores\, plus standings\,
  team pages and schedules.\n- **Favorite teams:** Follow your teams\, leag
 ues\, drivers and golfers and see their next game or live score on the hom
 e screen.\n- **Live Activities:** Follow the score from your Lock Screen a
 nd Dynamic Island.\n- **Smarter game search:** Tap a game and the app chec
 ks your TV guide for both teams around the start time\, then plays the rig
 ht channel or shows you the best matches.\n- **New search:** Live games\, 
 recently watched channels and your categories all in one place.\n- **Recor
 dings:** Stop\, delete or jump to the live channel right from the recordin
 gs section\, and recordings now show their own guide info.\n- **Connection
  warning:** If your provider only gives you one connection\, the app warns
  you before watching something else would cut off a recording.\n\n### **Fi
 xes**\n- If your login is wrong the app now tells you\, instead of droppin
 g you on an empty home screen. The guide also loads right away the first t
 ime you log in.\n- Streams don't keep playing sound anymore after you clos
 e them and lock your phone.\n- Smoother scrolling and less heat.\n- Show p
 ictures on the home screen only appear when they actually match the show.\
 n\n### **Under the Hood**\n- The code is open source now und
